+## 22:56 - Implement PLAN-012: retry transient translation request failures
+
+**Scope:** server/translate | **Type:** Feature | **Commit:** 7be134e @ doc-centric-vague
+
+## Scope
+server/translate
+
+## Type
+Feature
+
+## Commit
+- **Hash:** 7be134e
+- **Repo:** doc-centric-vague
+- **Message:** feat(translate): retry transient failures inside the translation request
+- **Author:** Satoshi Man <mrvuong.bitcoin@gmail.com>
+- **Date:** 2026-11-05 22:56:24 +0700
+
+## User request
+Implement the newest PLAN in CONTEXTS/03-implement-plan/ exactly per its scope and DoD. Commit, tick DoD items, set status: implemented, and log via event.py.
+
+## Reason
+User reported translation calls dying on transient network errors; PLAN-012 pins in-request retry with bounded backoff so blips do not consume outer translateSegment attempts or trigger premature fallback. Verified gates: typecheck, vitest 154/154, web build, web lint.
+
+## Description
+Added RetryPolicy, DEFAULT_RETRY_POLICY, and isRetryableTranslationError to openai-compat.ts; wrapped chat.completions.create in a per-endpoint retry loop with exponential backoff (250ms base, 2s cap) plus 50-100% jitter. Connection errors, 408/409/429/5xx, and unwrapped errors retry in place; 4xx, aborts, and TranslationError escalate to the fallback immediately. Extended fakeClient with per-call outcome queues and added retry/classification unit tests; marked PLAN-012 implemented with all DoD items checked.
+
+## Files changed
+server/translate/openai-compat.ts
+server/translate/openai-compat.test.ts
+CONTEXTS/03-implement-plan/PLAN-012-translation-request-retry.md
+
+## Notes
+Assist path can adopt the same RetryPolicy helper later (explicit follow-up). Retry-After header not honored; retry diagnostics/logging deferred.
+
